        "content": "<p>Should <code>ite_prop_iff_and</code> be <code>@[simp]</code>? There's a TODO suggesting it.<br>\nresolves the TODO, only 2 files need edits,  and build green</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/blob/555b02bc956f8a17a8dc95eb1131efda57d8b837/Mathlib/Logic/Basic.lean#L1013\">Mathlib/Logic/Basic.lean</a></p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- TODO make this a simp lemma in a future PR</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ite_prop_iff_and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↔</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">((</span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Q</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">¬</span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"n\">by_cases</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;;&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>File</th>\n<th>Change</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Mathlib/Tactic/FieldSimp/Lemmas.lean</code></td>\n<td>remove now-dead <code>split_ifs &lt;;&gt; tauto</code> in <code>zpow'_neg</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Mathlib/Combinatorics/SimpleGraph/Operations.lean</code></td>\n<td>re-prove <code>replaceVertex_self</code> without the old-normal-form <code>aesop</code> hint</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>I don't fully understand this yet, but this what I found</p>",
        "id": 604894862,
        "sender_full_name": "Attila Vajda",
        "timestamp": 1781877206
    },
