        "content": "<p><a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=ite_prop_iff_and#doc\">docs#ite_prop_iff_and</a>, <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=ite_prop_iff_or#doc\">docs#ite_prop_iff_or</a></p>",
